caption:
Kodak Black in the studio listening to “ZEZE” before it was released In 2018, Kodak Black heard the beat that would become “ZEZE” and immediately caught the energy. The infectious melody and heavy drums had him moving around the studio before the song had even become the massive hit fans would eventually know. It was one of those moments where you could tell the artist already knew he had something special.

Be real—y’all feeling this one?

